Not really (at least, *I* figured this out myself, so I supposed others
would also be able to figure this out). I notice that sometimes my pet
wouldn't step on certain items, and after a while also noticed that
sometimes it would do so, but only "reluctantly". I then started trying
to figure out what could be the case here, experimented a bit with some
level one characters I could afford to lose, and connected the
cursedness of armour and weapons with this.

